fn solveTernary to ulong
nc = get skSt 0
for id ulong 22 bound 22
ok = true
for i ulong nc bound 8
if ne evalTern id get skInA i get skInB i get skInC i get skTgt i
ok = false
break
end
end
if pickMatch ok
oClr
oTxt tFn3
